// PatroneOS's apt repository (billsecond.github.io/patrone-apt) takes the
// system's new name as its Label. apt stops updating from a repository whose
// Label changes until someone accepts it (apt-get update
// --allow-releaseinfo-change), which would stop PatroneOS's updates, in apt
// and in Patrone Software. This accepts a Label change, so they go on.
// Labels only name a repository: preferences here match on the Origin
// (patrone.pref), and a change of Origin, Suite or Codename is still refused.
Acquire::AllowReleaseInfoChange::Label "true";
